</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now that changeless love enfolds us,</l><l>All its wealth on us bestows;</l><l>While its pow’r unchanging holds us</l><l>In a holy calm repose.</l><l>God and Father, God and Father,</l><l>Unto Thee our worship flows,</l><l>Unto Thee our worship flows.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God of love, our souls adore Thee!</l><l>We would still Thy grace proclaim,</l><l>Till we cast our crowns before Thee,</l><l>And in glory praise Thy name;</l><l>Praise and worship, praise and worship</l><l>Be to God and to the Lamb!</l><l>Be to God and to the Lamb!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
